10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[30,28,55,60,53,51],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017705","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[30,28,55,60,53,51],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017705","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[30,28,55,60,53,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017705","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[30,28,55,60,53,51],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1017705","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"三国时期蜀汉官员，是刘备帐下重要谋士、尚书令法正之子。法邈一生的核心事迹围绕其父法正展开。建安二十五年，法正病逝，刘备极为悲痛，“为之流涕者累日”。为表彰法正的功勋，刘备追谥其为“翼侯”，并赐其子法邈关内侯的爵位。此后，法邈在蜀汉任职，官至奉车都尉，后外放为汉阳郡太守。","tc":"三國時期蜀漢官員，是劉備帳下重要謀士、尚書令法正之子。法邈一生的核心事跡圍繞其父法正展開。建安二十五年，法正病逝，劉備極為悲痛，“為之流涕者累日”。為表彰法正的功勛，劉備追謚其為“翼侯”，并賜其子法邈關內侯的爵位。此后，法邈在蜀漢任職，官至奉車都尉，后外放為漢陽郡太守。","en":"An official of Shu Han during the Three Kingdoms period, and the son of Fa Zheng, Secretariat Director and a key strategist under Liu Bei. Fa Miao's primary historical record revolves around his father's legacy. In the twenty-fifth year of Jian'an, Fa Zheng fell ill and died, Liu Bei was stricken with grief and ‘wept for him for several days.’ To honor Fa Zheng's meritorious service, Liu Bei posthumously granted him the title of ‘Marquis of Yi’ and enfeoffed his son, Fa Miao, as a Marquis Within the Passes. Thereafter, Fa Miao served Shu Han, reaching the position of Chief Commandant of the Imperial Carriages, and was later assigned away from court as Governor of Hanyang Commandery.","jp":"三国時代の蜀漢の官吏。劉備配下の重要な謀士にして尚書令を務めた法正の子。法邈の事績は主に父・法正にまつわるものである。建安二十五年、法正が病没すると、劉備は深く悲しみ、「為に流涕すること累日なり」とあるほどであった。劉備は法正の勲功を称えて「翼侯」と追諡し、その子の法邈に関内侯の爵位を授けた。その後、法邈は蜀漢に仕えて官位は奉車都尉に至り、のちに地方に出て漢陽郡太守を務めた。","kr":"삼국시대 촉한의 관료로, 유비 휘하의 주요 책사이자 상서령이었던 법정의 아들입니다. 법막의 생애 주요 행적은 부친인 법정을 중심으로 이어집니다. 건안 25년, 법정이 병으로 세상을 떠나자 유비는 '그를 위해 며칠 동안 눈물을 흘렸다'고 할 정도로 몹시 비통해했습니다. 유비는 법정의 공훈을 기리고자 그에게 '익후'라는 시호를 추증하고, 아들인 법막에게 관내후의 작위를 내렸습니다. 이후 법막은 촉한에서 벼슬길에 올라 관직이 봉거도위에 이르렀으며, 훗날 외직으로 나가 한양태수를 지냈습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1031315","remark":"","surname":"法","surnameTc":"法","surnameEn":"Fa","surnameJp":"法","surnameKr":"법","surnameOther":"","name":"邈","nameTc":"邈","nameEn":"Miao","nameJp":"邈","nameKr":"막","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"法邈","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"214","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"30","force":"28","wise":"55","politics":"60","charm":"53","will":"51","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"9/9/9/9/9/60/36/9","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1000","battleSoulPoint":"700","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1009901","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/1/1/0/1/2/0/1/2/1/1/1/1/0/0/1","attribute2":